    "birthplace": "",
    "residence": "Lucknow",
    "spouse": "Syeda Fatima Begum",
    "spouse_ur": "سیدہ فاطمہ بیگم",
    "notes": "Of Lucknow. Buried in Lucknow, consistent with the family's residence in Mohalla Nakkhas. The Talkatora Karbala in that quarter is a plausible burial site but has not been confirmed.\n\nThe Talkatora Karbala is a real, well-documented site: built around 1798 by Khuda Baksh Khan, a revenue official under Nawab Saadat Ali Khan, it is considered one of the most famous karbalas in Lucknow, located west of Alambagh Road. This strengthens (without confirming) it as a plausible burial site for the family's Lucknow-based ancestors.",
    "notes_ur": "لکھنؤ کے رہنے والے۔ لکھنؤ ہی میں مدفون ہیں، جو محلہ نکھاس میں خاندان کی رہائش سے مطابقت رکھتا ہے۔ اسی محلے کی تل کٹورہ کربلا ایک ممکنہ مدفن ہو سکتی ہے، مگر اس کی تصدیق نہیں ہوئی۔",
    "tag": "confirmed",
